description:
Chemist James F. Feeman in the Analytic Laboratory, using a Beckman Model DU (Ultraviolet/Visible) Spectrophotometer, 1951.
On counter, from left to right:
Paper Chromatography Jar;
Microscope and Lamp;
Ultraviolet Light Box (for identification of intermediate);
Beckman Model DU (Ultraviolet/Visible) Spectrophotometer;
Analytical Balance No. 35 (made by Henry Troemner for Aethurtt Thomas Co., Philadelphia, PA)
Interior of Althouse Chemical Plant Research Laboratory, 
